teamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414410/extras/cf1352d1b3cded0577a1d3cdf45cd97f.avif?t=1771807989\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it mean to be human?  In Tri City Monsters you'll come face to face with the answers.  Mori, Amir, and Akello all lead very separate lives with their own problems but they all have one thing in common: they've traded their humanity for power but they all got more than they bargained for- and with some greater power making moves from the shadows, the dangers are a lot higher than any of them anticipated. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help them cope with what's happened to them- by embracing their new demonic forms or by holding on to their humanity, the choice is yours- and maybe forge a deep and permanent connection.  In one form or another. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414410/extras/16b21f34b7b28797c5e54aee3433c395.poster.avif?t=1771807989\" width=584 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414410/extras/16b21f34b7b28797c5e54aee3433c395.webm?t=1771807989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414410/extras/16b21f34b7b28797c5e54aee3433c395.mp4?t=1771807989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414410/extras/5171d4bbe12b4fe5dc7af1ce9ad89d25.avif?t=1771807989\" width=800 height=65 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CURRENT</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your name and pronouns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your body type for sex scenes --&gt; Whether the p